{"type": "message.part.updated", "properties": {"sessionID": "ses_e0b321ec1ffeA8HkCv6MA3S5bC", "part": {"type": "text", "text": "Do these steps in order, one tool call each, then say DONE.\n1. Call the kestrel list_projects tool.\n2. Run the shell command `echo hi`.\n3. Create the file hello.txt containing the word hi.\n4. Edit notes.txt to replace the word two with three.\n5. Read the first line of /etc/hosts.\n6. Write a todo list with two items: check, report.", "messageID": "msg_1f4cde59e001liyDW3nnJ1NFJk", "sessionID": "ses_e0b321ec1ffeA8HkCv6MA3S5bC", "id": "prt_1f4cde59f001zxjUHXhdbmkLIx"}, "time": 1795108496808}}
